  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil. Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook in the boiling water until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes. Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add the butter and milk to potato and season generously with salt. Mash until smooth.\n• TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68083bdce83603ed23410fd4/step-7c4e5000.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While potato is cooking, preheat grill to high. Trim green beans. Finely chop garlic, carrot and onion. Drain and rinse cannellini beans.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot, onion and veggie mince, breaking up with a spoon, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add cannellini beans, garlic & herb seasoning and half the garlic, and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68083bdce83603ed23410fd4/step-18bebe10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in light cooking cream, vegetable stock pot and the water and simmer until thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Remove from heat and stir in baby spinach leaves until just wilted. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68083bdce83603ed23410fd4/step-1e0f5020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While pie is grilling, wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook green beans until tender, 4-5 minutes. Add remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68083bdce83603ed23410fd4/step-69895330.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While pie is grilling, wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook green beans until tender, 4-5 minutes. Add remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68083bdce83603ed23410fd4/step-9c478540.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide creamy Italian butter bean and veggie mince pie and garlicky greens between plates.\n• Sprinkle over flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68083bdce83603ed23410fd4/step-07ed8650.jpg"
    }
  ]
